sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser / App
    participant C as Backend (client)
    participant AS as Auth Server
    participant API as Resource API

    B->>AS: /authorize + PKCE challenge
    AS->>B: login → redirect with code
    B->>C: callback?code=...
    C->>AS: POST /token (code + verifier)
    AS-->>C: access + id + refresh tokens
    C->>API: Bearer access_token
    API->>API: verify sig, iss, aud, exp
    API-->>C: 200
